        "# OpenTelemetry GenAI Semantic Conventions Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "`code/main.py` implements a stdlib span emitter matching GenAI conventions:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- `Span` with GenAI attribute schema."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- `Tracer` with `start_span`, nested contexts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- A scripted agent run that emits: `create_agent`, `invoke_agent` (INTERNAL), per-tool spans, `chat` spans for LLM calls."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- A content-capture mode that stores prompts externally and records IDs on spans."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Run it:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "python3 code/main.py"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Output: a span tree with all required GenAI attributes, and an \"external store\" showing the opt-in content references."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Instrument your Lesson 01 ReAct loop with `invoke_agent` (INTERNAL) + per-tool spans. Send to a Jaeger instance.\n2. Add content capture in \"references only\" mode: prompts to SQLite, span attributes carry only row IDs.\n3. Read the spec for `gen_ai.data_source.id`. Wire it into your Lesson 09 Mem0 search.\n4. Set `OTEL_SEMCONV_STABILITY_OPT_IN=gen_ai_latest_experimental` and verify your attributes don't get renamed by the collector.\n5. Build a dashboard: \"which tool errors correlate with which models\" from GenAI attributes alone."
      ]
    }
